#!/usr/bin/env bash
set -eu
git init -q -b main
git config user.name Eval
git config user.email eval@example.com
git config commit.gpgsign false
save() {
	git add -A
	git commit -qm "$1"
}
echo "# demo" >README.md
save "chore: start"
git checkout -qb feat/work
cat >PLAN.md <<'MD'
# Plan

Decision: Tests deferred.

| Unit | Status  |
| ---- | ------- |
| U1   | pending |
| U2   | pending |
MD
cat >PLAN_DETAILS.md <<'MD'
# Details

## Setup

Test: `python3 -m unittest`

## Decisions

Tests deferred: the plan is large enough for tests to wait.

## Units

### U1

- Files: `alpha.py`
- Acceptance: `alpha()` returns 1.

### U2

- Files: `beta.py`
- Acceptance: `beta()` returns 2.
- Depends on: U1
MD
